{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20260726/photo/bkn-20260726000545647-0726_00822_001_01p.jpg?20260726001850\"/><p>深圳灣公路大橋於今晨零時30分封閉。</p><p>八號西北烈風或暴風信號生效下，深圳灣公路大橋將於今日(26日)凌晨零時30分封閉。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T16:39:33.242802+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":68,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"}}